  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc65:1.48": "Sp-ṭ 4.295: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Sarīsapeti ye keci sarante gacchante dīghajātike</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Sarīsape</i>: whatever long creatures are moving by flowing.” ",
